   "source": [
    "## 5. Diffusion Modelleri (Ch. 18)\n",
    "\n",
    "### İleri Süreç (Forward Process)\n",
    "Veriyi adım adım Gaussian gürültüyle bozarız:\n",
    "$$q(x_t | x_{t-1}) = \\mathcal{N}(x_t; \\sqrt{1-\\beta_t} x_{t-1}, \\beta_t I)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Geri Süreç (Reverse Process)\n",
    "Eğitilen ağ, gürültüyü her adımda tahmin ederek veriyi geri yükler.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "dcd07fcd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Diffusion ileri süreç - 1D örnek\n",
    "T = 50\n",
    "betas = np.linspace(1e-4, 0.02, T)  # noise schedule\n",
    "alphas = 1 - betas\n",
    "alpha_bars = np.cumprod(alphas)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Başlangıç verisi: Gaussian karışımı\n",
    "np.random.seed(3)\n",
    "x0_data = np.concatenate([\n",
    "    np.random.normal(-2, 0.4, 300),\n",
    "    np.random.normal( 2, 0.4, 300),\n",
    "])\n",
    "\n",
    "def forward_diffusion(x0, t):\n",
    "    alpha_bar_t = alpha_bars[t]\n",
    "    noise = np.random.randn(*x0.shape)\n",
    "    xt = np.sqrt(alpha_bar_t) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - alpha_bar_t) * noise\n",
    "    return xt, noise\n",
    "\n",
    "# Farklı zaman adımlarında dağılım\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 6, figsize=(16, 3))\n",
    "time_steps = [0, 5, 10, 20, 35, T-1]\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, t in zip(axes, time_steps):\n",
    "    xt, _ = forward_diffusion(x0_data, t)\n",
    "    ax.hist(xt, bins=40, density=True, color='steelblue', alpha=0.8, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    x_range = np.linspace(-4, 4, 100)\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_range, norm.pdf(x_range, 0, 1), 'r--', lw=1.5, label=\"N(0,1)\")\n",
    "    ab = alpha_bars[t]\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"t={t}\\nSNR={ab/(1-ab):.2f}\")\n",
    "    ax.set_xlim(-5, 5); ax.set_ylim(0, 1.5)\n",
    "    if t == 0: ax.set_xlabel(\"Gercek veri\")\n",
    "    if t == T-1: ax.set_xlabel(\"Pure gurultu\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Diffusion Ileri Surec: Veriden Gurultuye\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb08_diffusion_fwd.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9a0bc554",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Noise schedule görselleştirmesi\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "t_range = np.arange(T)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].plot(t_range, betas, 'steelblue', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Gurultu Planı (betas)\"); axes[0].set_xlabel(\"t\"); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].plot(t_range, alpha_bars, 'crimson', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Kumulatif Alfa (alpha_bar)\"); axes[1].set_xlabel(\"t\"); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Sinyal gucunun kalanı\")\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[2].plot(t_range, np.sqrt(alpha_bars), 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"sqrt(alpha_bar) ~ sinyal\")\n",
    "axes[2].plot(t_range, np.sqrt(1-alpha_bars), 'crimson', lw=2, label=\"sqrt(1-alpha_bar) ~ gurultu\")\n",
    "axes[2].set_title(\"Sinyal vs Gurultu Orani\"); axes[2].set_xlabel(\"t\")\n",
    "axes[2].legend(); axes[2].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb08_noise_schedule.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
